<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>DMW Briefing Portal</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #2ecc71; /* Driving school green theme */
            --bg-color: #f8f9fa;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-color: #2c3e50;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: var(--bg-color); color: var(--text-color); padding: 20px; }
        header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 25px; padding-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #eaeded; }
        header h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--text-color); }
        header p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #7f8c8d; }
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 15px; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
        @media(min-width: 600px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
        .card { background: var(--card-bg); border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border-left: 5px solid var(--primary-color); }
        .card h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .video-container { position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden; background: #e5e8e8; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .video-container iframe, .video-container video, .video-placeholder { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none; }
        .video-placeholder { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: #34495e; color: #fff; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; padding: 10px; }
        .notes { font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.4; color: #566573; background: #fdfefe; padding: 8px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #eaeded; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>DMW Briefing Portal</h1>
        <p>Interactive 3D Driving Guides & Manoeuvres</p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid">
        <!-- Manoeuvre 1 -->
        <div class="card">
            <h2>1. Parallel Parking</h2>
            <div class="video-container">
                <!-- Placeholder until 3D video is ready -->
                <div class="video-placeholder">3D Animation Coming Soon<br>(Parallel Park Reference Points)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="notes">
                <strong>Key Points:</strong> Pull up level with target car. Select reverse. Check all around blindspots. Turn left when your rear wheels clear their bumper.
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Manoeuvre 2 -->
        <div class="card">
            <h2>2. Emerging at Junctions</h2>
            <div class="video-container">
                <div class="video-placeholder">3D Animation Coming Soon<br>(T-Junction Bird's Eye View)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="notes">
                <strong>Key Points:</strong> M-S-M routine. Assess junction early. Look right, look left, look right again. Creep forward using clutch control if view is restricted.
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Manoeuvre 3 -->
        <div class="card">
            <h2>3. Roundabouts</h2>
            <div class="video-container">
                <div class="video-placeholder">3D Animation Coming Soon<br>(Lane Discipline Rules)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="notes">
                <strong>Key Points:</strong> Check mirrors and signal early. Give way to traffic already on the roundabout from your right. Maintain proper lane discipline.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
